# To Each His Own Right section 1 in Windurst Woods. The login plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 839 (that
# mission's event, not this one's). Rakoh Buuma's own script plays the gate guards' mission list 114; its finish with
# option 0 does nothing, with option 10 begins the mission and says YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION. Then Rakoh Buuma 182, Sola
# Jaab 184, Tih Pikeh 183.
lists PortWindurst/Hakkuru-Rinkuru/onTrigger PortWindurst/onEventFinish/78 PortWindurst/onEventFinish/147 WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/93 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/111 WindurstWoods/Rakoh_Buuma/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Sola_Jaab/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Tih_Pikeh/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/114 CastleOztroja/onEventFinish/43 HeavensTower/Foo_Beibo/onTrigger HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/Rhy_Epocan/onTrigger HeavensTower/Shaz_Norem/onTrigger HeavensTower/Ufu_Koromoa/onTrigger HeavensTower/Vahn_Paineesha/onTrigger HeavensTower/onEventFinish/103 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/107 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/114
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=108,-5,-24 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=2
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Windurst TheHorutotoRuinsExperiment completed
mission Windurst TheHeartOfTheMatter completed
mission Windurst ThePriceOfPeace completed
mission Windurst LostForWords completed
mission Windurst ATestingTime completed
mission Windurst TheThreeKingdoms completed
login
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                            # section 1: 114
finish option=0                         # not 10: nothing
trigger Rakoh_Buuma
finish option=10                        # begun
trigger Rakoh_Buuma                     # 182
finish-if-event
trigger Sola_Jaab                       # 184
finish-if-event
trigger Tih_Pikeh                       # 183
finish-if-event
